Subject Changes~
Text
Changes:
1) You can now pour out a drink container (pour <container> out) and
then pour a potion into a drink container. You may pour several of the
same potion type into the container, and each time you drink from the
container it is the same as quaffing the potion.
 
2) Questmasters now operate more like shopkeepers, in that not every
questmaster will have the same inventory so it's worthwhile to check
every questmaster you see, you never know which one might have something
unique and unusual.
 
3) World Maps. We now have the world map system by Hades Kane, and I intend
on using it quite a lot to make the travel from one area to another more
interesting and potentially eventful.
 
4) Donation pits and donation rooms now persist through reboots.
This will be expanded to include clan vaults, and personal chests
in player homes.
 
5) Quest tokens will be scattered all over the world, of different
values. These also persist through reboots.
 
6) We have a website! https://reaux.vineyard.haus !
~

